{"parentUuid":"af55b181-caf2-4fa2-97a8-49292c6279b6","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"add24b2dd9d00df6b","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01LStCDKNvxy3UmAziSNPWKS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AcgVXj8kgL5UmVaPg6bGLV","name":"PowerShell","input":{"command":"$repos = @(\"secnot/rectpack\",\"ktnr/BinPacking2D\",\"AlkiviadisAleiferis/hyperpack\",\"JeroenGar/sparrow\",\"enzoruiz/3dbinpacking\",\"jerry800416/3D-bin-packing\"); foreach ($r in $repos) { try { $j = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri \"https://api.github.com/repos/$r\" -Headers @{ \"User-Agent\"=\"ps\" }; \"$r | pushed=$($j.pushed_at) | stars=$($j.stargazers_count) | archived=$($j.archived)\" } catch { \"$r | err=$($_.Exception.Message)\" } }","description":"Check repo activity for packing libs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3351,"cache_read_input_tokens":26515,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3351,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":43,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoyAm8pFV4k4J7wNNpms","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"2bdba824-4bb2-43f7-b3fd-f0e9b233b51f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:07:05.115Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"2bdba824-4bb2-43f7-b3fd-f0e9b233b51f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"add24b2dd9d00df6b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcgVXj8kgL5UmVaPg6bGLV","type":"tool_result","content":"secnot/rectpack | pushed=11/24/2021 23:35:02 | stars=557 | archived=False\r\nktnr/BinPacking2D | pushed=05/06/2025 12:14:25 | stars=82 | archived=False\r\nAlkiviadisAleiferis/hyperpack | pushed=03/04/2026 22:22:20 | stars=31 | archived=False\r\nJeroenGar/sparrow | pushed=05/07/2026 09:28:40 | stars=249 | archived=False\r\nenzoruiz/3dbinpacking | pushed=12/14/2023 05:24:00 | stars=448 | archived=False\r\njerry800416/3D-bin-packing | pushed=09/03/2024 15:00:20 | stars=272 | archived=False","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"60a26a5e-6c9b-4211-b0c3-10237f080f0a","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:07:11.635Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2bdba824-4bb2-43f7-b3fd-f0e9b233b51f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"60a26a5e-6c9b-4211-b0c3-10237f080f0a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"add24b2dd9d00df6b","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01EJfEijAm3hhuJeFWTMfGSH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All data gathered. Compiling the survey.\n\n---\n\n# 2D Packing Solver 调研（除 OR-Tools 外）\n\n## 1. BinPacking2D (ktnr)\n\n- 仓库 https://github.com/ktnr/BinPacking2D，82★，最近 push 2025-05-06，**仍在维护**。\n- 性质：**精确求解器**（branch-and-cut + CP），目标是经典 2D-BPP（矩形件装箱），不是固定网格上的 max-rectangle。子问题 2D-OPP 用 CP（or-tools CP-SAT）跑可行性，外层 B&C 处理装箱组合。\n- 500 个 benchmark，多数 20 分钟内出最优；难点正好是\"小件多\"——它自己也会被 CP-SAT 卡 300s+。\n- 跟我们场景契合度：**低**。它解的是\"多个 bin 装 N 个矩形\"，我们是\"单一 70×70 网格内 ghost 矩形 + 266 mandatory\"。模型形态不一致，用它做 warm-start 等于把问题改写一遍。\n\n## 2. rectpack (secnot)\n\n- 557★，但**最近 push 2021-11**，事实停滞。还有一堆 fork 在自维护。\n- 算法：纯启发式——Skyline / MaxRects / Guillotine 三家及变种。无目标函数最优性保证，只追求\"塞得下\"。\n- 契合度：**中等可借**。我们 outer search 需要快速\"给一组 placements 找一个可行布置\"作为种子，rectpack 能在毫秒级吐出一个 valid placement，但它不知道 mandatory 实例的\"必须在某些 footprint 内\"约束，需要把已固定的 266 个先 reserve 成\"已占 bin\"，再让它塞剩余物 —— 包装代码量不小。\n\n## 3. py3dbp / py2dbp / 3dbinpacking 系\n\n- py3dbp：**inactive**（PyPI 12 月无新版）。3D 取向，目标是体积/重量装箱，不是平面 max-rectangle。\n- enzoruiz/3dbinpacking：448★，2023-12 后停。jerry800416 fork 272★，2024-09 后停。\n- 契合度：**几乎为零**。3D bin packing 关心的是 (w,h,d,weight,旋转)，跟我们 2D 网格 + 输运路径完全不在同一个问题域。\n\n## 4. 专用 strip packing solver\n\n- **hyperpack** (AlkiviadisAleiferis)：31★，**最近 push 2026-03**，活跃。纯 Python、零依赖、多进程；v1.1.0 起支持 strip packing，提供 `hypersearch()` / `local_search()`。规模 30-100 件还行，266 件量级没人 benchmark 过。\n- **Sparrow** (JeroenGar) + 论文 arxiv 2509.13329（2025）：Rust 实现，249★，**最近 push 2026-05-07**，是 2D **irregular** strip packing 当前 SOTA。有 Python 包装 `spyrrow`。但它专攻**不规则多边形 nesting**（皮革、布料），矩形场景属于杀鸡用牛刀，且没有\"必须放在指定 footprint\"的接口。\n- 经典 strip packing 不是我们的目标——我们高度（70）固定不能压缩。\n\n## 5. 跟 70×70 + 266 设施场景契合度\n\n我们的问题形状特殊：\n- **网格离散**（不是连续坐标），70×70 = 4900 格\n- **mandatory 实例的 footprint 固定**（266 个\"必须放在那\"，不是\"挑位置\"）\n- **目标 max_lex(area, min_side) 的 ghost 矩形**，加上路由/绑定/流约束（Benders 子问题）\n- 真正的搜索空间是\"非 mandatory 的可选放置 + ghost 矩形位置\"\n\n所有上面的库都是**单纯几何装箱**——没有路由、没有 commodity flow、没有 lex 目标。借任何一个都只能解决 placement 子问题里的一小块。\n\n## 是否能借用作 warm-start\n\n**有限可行，性价比一般**。\n\n- 最现实的做法是 **rectpack 或 hyperpack 给 outer search 喂一个\"非 mandatory 候选的快速可行布置\"**作为初始 frontier 节点，让 CP-SAT 在更好的种子上展开。把 266 个 mandatory 当成预占用的\"已放入 bin 的固定矩形\"，rectpack 的 MaxRects 能在毫秒级给一个候选解。\n- 但 warm-start CP-SAT 需要把外部解翻译成 `AddHint(x, x_val)`，且 ghost 矩形 + Benders 切的语义这些库**完全不知道**——它给的解不一定能让 binding/routing 子问题可行，warm-start 失败率会偏高。\n- **Sparrow / BinPacking2D** 不建议借用：前者是不规则 nesting，后者是多 bin 装箱，模型不对路。\n- **py3dbp 系彻底放弃**：三维 + 维护停滞。\n\n**结论：值得做的是写一个 200 行的 rectpack/hyperpack adapter 当 warm-start hint generator，预期贡献是首解时间提速、不改变最终最优性。但优先级低于 Lane B 的 CP-SAT 参数调优——后者是同类问题的同行求解器内部机制，收益更直接。**\n\nSources:\n- [BinPacking2D (ktnr)](https://github.com/ktnr/BinPacking2D)\n- [rectpack (secnot)](https://github.com/secnot/rectpack)\n- [hyperpack](https://github.com/AlkiviadisAleiferis/hyperpack)\n- [hyperpack on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/hyperpack/)\n- [Sparrow (JeroenGar)](https://github.com/JeroenGar/sparrow)\n- [spyrrow Python wrapper](https://github.com/PaulDL-RS/spyrrow)\n- [arxiv 2509.13329 – open-source heuristic to reboot 2D nesting](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.13329)\n- [py3dbp on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/py3dbp/)\n- [enzoruiz/3dbinpacking](https://github.com/enzoruiz/3dbinpacking)\n- [jerry800416/3D-bin-packing](https://github.com/jerry800416/3D-bin-packing)\n- [CP-SAT Primer (warm-start hints)](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/04B_advanced_modelling.html)\n- [YAMPC: 2D bin packing with CP-SAT](http://yetanothermathprogrammingconsultant.blogspot.com/2021/02/2d-bin-packing-with-google-or-tools-cp.html)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":588,"cache_read_input_tokens":29866,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":588,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoyBmh5Sx5qdoVBHYmCn","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"3201cd0c-075b-4ebb-b308-58580fc80cd9","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:08:02.318Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
